        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Add type: "text" import attribute]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43505</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43505"/>
        <updated>2026-03-23T11:01:04.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/617000?u=444f1f3af7f90878cc20be018673336add943dd7&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Adds documentation for the upcoming <code class="notranslate">type: 'text'</code> import attribute.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">I'm the proposal champion, and would like to advance it.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<p dir="auto">The proposal is specified in:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a href="https://github.com/tc39/proposal-import-text">tc39/proposal-import-text</a></li>
